Package: svyplan
Type: Package
Title: Survey Sample Size Determination and Precision Analysis
Version: 0.26.2
Authors@R: person(given = "Ahmadou",
                  family = "Dicko",
                  email = "mail@ahmadoudicko.com",
                  comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9654-7582"),
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for survey sample size determination, precision
    analysis, optimal allocation, stratification, power analysis, and
    planning for surveys repeated over time. Covers proportions, means and
    ratios, from simple random samples to multistage cluster, multidomain
    and two-phase designs. Sample size and precision functions are inverse
    of each other through S3 dispatch, and predict methods give
    sensitivity analysis. Based on methods from Cochran (1977)
    <ISBN:978-0-471-16240-7>, Kish (1965) <ISBN:978-0-471-48900-9>,
    Saerndal, Swensson, and Wretman (1992) <ISBN:978-0-387-40620-6>,
    Fuller (2009) <ISBN:978-0-470-45460-2>, and Valliant, Dever, and
    Kreuter (2018) <ISBN:978-3-319-93631-4>.
